    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sluggish Soldier",
        "text": "Hey, did you hear? Supposedly that guest of honor we were keeping an eye on, the Doctor or whatever, was attacked by Silverash's people?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_283_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nosy Soldier",
        "text": "You only just heard about it? The news is everywhere."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_283_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sluggish Soldier",
        "text": "Then why don't you tell me what the hell is going on? Wasn't this Doctor person invited by Enciodes himself?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_283_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nosy Soldier",
        "text": "Well, the version of the story I heard is, the attackers apparently thought that after the Doctor went over, Arctosz offered some under-the-table deals."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_283_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sluggish Soldier",
        "text": "Huh? Master Arctosz wouldn't do something like that!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_283_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nosy Soldier",
        "text": "Dumbass, can't you tell this is obviously nonsense made up by the attackers?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_283_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nosy Soldier",
        "text": "If you ask me, after finding out that Arctosz is going to be hosting the Doctor, Enciodes is trying to set Arctosz up."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_283_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Nosy Soldier",
        "text": "Maybe the people behind the attack were sent by Enciodes too."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_283_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sluggish Soldier",
        "text": "Yeah, that makes sense, just as you said."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_283_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_284_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sluggish Soldier",
        "text": "Then why are we spending all this time keeping tabs on this Doctor? They're probably not in cahoots with Enciodes."
