    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz",
        "text": "Valais, we always said you were a skilled tactician and had a good head on your shoulders. But looks like you still have a lot to learn from the Doctor."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_261_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Valais",
        "text": "You're exactly right, Sir."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz",
        "text": "Oh, right, Valais. Pass this message on for me\u00a0\u2013 My men don't need to keep watch over the Doctor anymore. Just focus on guarding our territory."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz",
        "text": "As for the guards the Doctor brought along, they will be allowed to come and go freely from now on."
