        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_254_1#10$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz",
        "text": "I don't have any interest in your guessing games, but I might be able to offer you some clues."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_254_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz",
        "text": "Kjeragandr is our witness. Doctor, I apologize for the rudeness of the Paleroche clan\u2013\u2013"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_254_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz",
        "text": "On my name as head of the house of Paleroche, I swear to Kjeragandr that I was not the one who instigated this attack."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_254_1#7$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz",
        "text": "If you are willing to believe me, let me assure you that there are absolutely no scoundrels in the Paleroche clan that would carry out such a malicious attack behind my back."
    },
