        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz",
        "text": "Doctor, I may not be much of a philosopher, but even a rough-around-the-edges man like me can smell that there's something unusual brewing in Kjerag."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz",
        "text": "That damned Enciodes, suddenly talking about ceding power back to the Saintess, then driving Gnosis away, and now putting you in this position..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz",
        "text": "And someone attacked you in the midst of it all."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_254_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz",
        "text": "Let me be honest \u2013 I can't help but to suspect that Enciodes is up to no good, even if he hasn't shown the slightest flaw in what he's doing."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_254_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz",
        "text": "But I'm not going to sit around and wait for the land granted to us by Kjeragandr to fall into danger..."
