            "fadetime": 0.7
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.7
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos",
        "text": "Gnosis Edelweiss."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis",
        "text": "Madame Ratatos Browntail."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis",
        "text": "It seems like I've finally earned the privilege of talking with you face-to-face?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos",
        "text": "You can't fool me with that feigned humility, Gnosis."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos",
        "text": "You are plenty smart yourself. Let there be no shady dealings between honest people."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos",
        "text": "If you didn't want something from me, you would not have been trying to meet me again and again."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#2$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis",
        "text": "Heh. If you're just trying to assert your dominance here, then I do believe it is time for me to bid thee farewell."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#2$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos",
        "text": "Don't be in such a hurry, Gnosis. I have a few questions for you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#2$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos",
        "text": "When I first heard that the Edelweiss clan followed Enciodes back to Kjerag, I frankly was not too surprised."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#2$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos",
        "text": "I thought you either had some evidence to prove that the Edelweisses would not be adverse to the Silverash clan, or perhaps, you had something to hold over Enciodes."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#2$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos",
        "text": "But neither you nor Enciodes have said anything about what happened back then, while you still allow the Silverashes to rebuke you for your shamelessness."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#10$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#2$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos",
        "text": "What keeps you going? I'm curious."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#10$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis",
        "text": "...He promised me a future."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos",
        "text": "A future?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis",
        "text": "Kjerag's future. An emerging industrial country that would allow me to utilize my talent in research without fear of plagiarism, misuse, or suppression."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#7$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos",
        "text": "That's all?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#7$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#4$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis",
        "text": "Needless to say, I never expected you to understand in the first place, Ratatos. You will never be a researcher after all."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#7$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#4$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis",
        "text": "It may be difficult for you to understand how thrilling it is to freely explore the innovation and application of technology, backed by plenty of resources and privilege. To be given a legitimate purpose."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#4$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos",
        "text": "So that's the deal you struck. You give him your skills, and he provides you a stage."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#4$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos",
        "text": "And then what?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#4$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos",
        "text": "Surely you aren't going to tell me that he pushed you out and made you take the fall just to protect himself."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#4$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos",
        "text": "Is this all that Karlan Trade's cost-benefit analysis amounts to?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis",
        "text": "You seem to have a lot of faith in Karlan Trade. Why didn't you accept the offer to work under Enciodes two years ago?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#7$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos",
        "text": "Don't be ridiculous. No matter how powerful Enciodes is, he cannot change the faith that has been deeply rooted in the bones of our people for thousands of years."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#7$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos",
        "text": "Karlan Trade can only grow as big as the Tri-Clan Council and the Vine-Bead Court allow, and it is impossible for Kjerag to industrialize\u2013\u2013"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos",
        "text": "\u2014Wait."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos",
        "text": "So he's found a new bargaining chip?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#2$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis",
        "text": "Exactly."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#5$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis",
        "text": "There was no way for Enciodes to turn the people of Kjerag against Kjeragandr, so he had to reach a compromise."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#5$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis",
        "text": "But he's been stuck there for far too long. No matter how many times I tried to push him, he seems indifferent."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis",
        "text": "Until there finally came an opportunity to turn things around."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis",
        "text": "Ensia's Oripathy symptoms are under control, and though there still isn't a cure, she was able to return to him alive and well..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis",
        "text": "...and excitedly told him that it might be possible to deepen cooperation with an outside party to better control the spread and harm of Oripathy at a lower cost."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#5$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos",
        "text": "No, Enciodes wouldn't..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#7$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis",
        "text": "Of course not. Once the gate to Kjerag is opened, it cannot be completely sealed again."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#7$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis",
        "text": "The number of Infected living in Kjerag will only increase\u2013 this is the reality of our world. During the process of Kjerag's continued development, the ability to deal with Oripathy will ultimately become a new bargaining chip."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#2$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#7$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis",
        "text": "He is about to make the people of Kjerag decide between faith and technology, and faith alone will no longer protect them from Oripathy."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#7$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#7$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos",
        "text": "Empty rhetoric. There's no proof."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_253_1#7$1",
            "name2": "avg_206_gnosis_1#9$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Gnosis",
        "text": "Come with me then. Bring your people along, including those who can fight, and I will show you something."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
